WEBVTT

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:31.634
that's been revived every decade since:

00:13:31.634 --> 00:13:33.648
autonomous vehicles.

00:13:33.648 --> 00:13:35.386
Now you're thinking, give me a break.

00:13:35.386 --> 00:13:38.904
How can a fancy version of cruise control

00:13:38.904 --> 00:13:40.604
be profound?

00:13:40.604 --> 00:13:42.728
Look, much of our world

00:13:42.728 --> 00:13:46.211
has been designed around 
roads and transportation.

00:13:46.211 --> 00:13:48.086
These were as essential to the success

00:13:48.086 --> 00:13:49.584
of the Roman Empire

00:13:49.584 --> 00:13:51.569
as the interstate highway system

00:13:51.569 --> 00:13:53.363
to the prosperity and development

00:13:53.363 --> 00:13:55.573
of the United States.

00:13:55.573 --> 00:13:58.607
Today, these roads that interconnect our world

00:13:58.607 --> 00:14:00.705
are dominated by cars and trucks